Chia-Ping Tsai resolved KAFKA-17461.
------------------------------------
    Fix Version/s: 4.0.0
       Resolution: Fixed

> move the .github/readme to ./github/workflows/readme
> ----------------------------------------------------
>
>                 Key: KAFKA-17461
>                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-17461
>             Project: Kafka
>          Issue Type: Improvement
>            Reporter: Chia-Ping Tsai
>            Assignee: Kuan Po Tseng
>            Priority: Major
>             Fix For: 4.0.0
>
>
> According to GitHub readme rules (
> https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-readmes) :
> {quote}
> https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-readmes
> {quote}
> the file `.github/readme` will override root/readme ... Hence, we should move .github/readme to ./github/workflows/readme



--
