>
> I would like to start a discussion on KIP-1088:
>
> https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1088%3A+Replace+Kaf=
kaClientSupplier+with+KafkaClientInterceptor
>
> We consider this KIP a requirement/blocker for KIP-1071.
>
> For the beginning of the discussion, I would like to stay focused on the
> _how_ and not necessarily talk about names... I am happy to change any
> class/methods names, but it might be distracting in the beginning of the
> discussion.
>
> Looking forward to your feedback.
>
>
> -Matthias
>

