Matthias J. Sax created KAFKA-17488:
---------------------------------------

             Summary: Cleanup (test) code for Kafka Streams "metric version"
                 Key: KAFKA-17488
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-17488
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Task
          Components: streams, unit tests
            Reporter: Matthias J. Sax


In Kafka Streams, we move from old metrics to new metrics, and added a config for users to explicitly opt into using the new metric.

While we did remove old metric in the code base completely, we kept the config (what is desired, as if we make a similar change in the future the config would just be there), however, there is still code left which still uses the config for no good reason (especially test code).

It might be worth to cleanup a little bit.



