> >
> https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-848%3A+The+Next+Gen=
eration+of+the+Consumer+Rebalance+Protocol#KIP848:TheNextGenerationoftheCon=
sumerRebalanceProtocol-AssignmentEpoch-Computethegroupassignment
