ache.org>
> > >>>> wrote:
> > >>>>>>
> > >>>>>> Hi all,
> > >>>>>>
> > >>>>>> Josep has been a Kafka committer since December 2022. He has
> > >> remained
> > >>>>> very
> > >>>>>> active and instructive in the community since then, and it's my
> > >>>> pleasure
> > >>>>> to
> > >>>>>> announce that he has accepted our invitation to become a member =
of
> > >>> the
> > >>>>>> Kafka PMC.
> > >>>>>>
> > >>>>>> Congratulations Josep! Enjoy voting on those release candidates =
:)
