> KIP-714 introduced client metrics resources to kafka-configs.sh. The option --entity-type client-metrics was added, and a shorthand of "client-metrics" was also included in the comments. However, the "-client-metrics" option whose syntax matches all of the other entity types was omitted. This corrects that omission.



