TengYao Chi resolved KAFKA-17324.
---------------------------------
    Resolution: Fixed

> Set config group.protocol to classic in Streams
> -----------------------------------------------
>
>                 Key: KAFKA-17324
>                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-17324
>             Project: Kafka
>          Issue Type: Task
>          Components: streams
>            Reporter: Bruno Cadonna
>            Assignee: TengYao Chi
>            Priority: Blocker
>             Fix For: 4.0.0
>
>
> Streams is not compatible with the new consumer rebalance protocol proposed in KIP-848. Thus, Streams should set/override config {{group.protocol}} to {{classic}} at startup to ensure that the classic protocol is used. 



