             Summary: Clear build scan PR status when re-running the tests
                 Key: KAFKA-17572
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-17572
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Bug
          Components: build
            Reporter: David Arthur


When we "Re-run jobs" from the GitHub run UI, it does not clear the PR statuses since there is no new commit. The result is that the build scan checks remain in place while the tests are running. This could lead to confusion if the tests were aborted.



