> TestUtils.tempDirectory registers a shutdown hook to clean up the tempora=
ry directory on JVM exit. But it also calls file.deleteOnExit, which essent=
ially does the same thing. There's no reason to do both, setting up a shutd=
own hook via Exit.addShutdownHook should be good enough.



