Alyssa Huang created KAFKA-17604:
------------------------------------

             Summary: Describe quorum output missing added voters endpoints
                 Key: KAFKA-17604
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-17604
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Bug
            Reporter: Alyssa Huang


Describe quorum output will miss endpoints of voters which were added via add_raft_voter. This is due to a bug in LeaderState's updateVoterAndObserverStates which will pull replica state from observer states map (which does not include endpoints). The fix is to populate endpoints from the lastVoterSet passed into the method.



