I think new JDK support is a new feature rather than a bugfix. So we wou=
ldn't include it in 3.9.x for that reason.

It may be a compatible new feature, of course (most new features are...)=
 but still a new feature.

I'll comment more on the KIP-1006 thread... my main comment there is tha=
t I'd like to understand more about what actual Kafka release will remov=
e SecurityManager before we vote (sounds like it won't be 4.0).

best,
Colin


