Chia-Ping Tsai created KAFKA-17655:
--------------------------------------

             Summary: add example of changing the e2e image name
                 Key: KAFKA-17655
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-17655
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
            Reporter: Chia-Ping Tsai
            Assignee: Chia-Ping Tsai


The default Docker image name used by E2E is {{{}ducker-ak-openjdk-8{}}}. When switching to a different branch to run E2E tests, Docker may rebuild the image due to changes in the Dockerfile. We should include an example to remind developers that they can override the image name by setting the "image_name" environment variable. This allows using different names for each branch to prevent unnecessary rebuilding.



--
