            Assignee: Chia-Ping Tsai


https://github.com/apache/kafka/blob/6ee46ea86530e019798ba0d4183164d7925dde63/clients/src/main/java/org/apache/kafka/clients/consumer/internals/FetchMetricsRegistry.java#L144

The `groupName` is derived from the input, so using the constant "consumer-fetch-manager-metrics" for the group is not appropriate. While it hasn't caused issues so far because the input has always been "consumer," addressing this now can help prevent potential bugs in the future.



