Justine Olshan created KAFKA-17671:
--------------------------------------

             Summary: Create better documentation for transactions
                 Key: KAFKA-17671
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-17671
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Task
            Reporter: Justine Olshan


There is not a single source of truth that explains how transactions should work in kafka.

We should create a document that explains how they work, the guarantees, and tips for how to design applications that use transactions.



